step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a robust median over the most stable pool1 models to see if median beats trimmed_mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test the best single model FT_rf to see if a single strong model beats the robust combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a median over pool2 to see if restricting to more correlated models improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a median over pool3 to see if expanding to include FT_rf improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over pool2 to see if a more flexible combination can beat the robust single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on ARIMA to see if a different single model can outperform FT_rf or provide a more robust alternative.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Try a dba approach on the larger pool3 to see if a more complex weighting beats the best single FT_rf.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over the full model pool (all 19 models) to see if expanding the pool improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a different single model that may outperform FT_rf, e.g. ONLY_CWT_catboost.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_CWT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination over pool2 using the existing w1 handle to see if a more focused pool improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","rf","DWT_rf","ONLY_DWT_rf"],"weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean over pool4 (most models) to see if expanding the pool improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the more stable pool1 to see if iterative refinement improves over the trimmed_mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

